landline (0.3.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bluetooth is no longer restarted while the package is installed or
    removed: doing so while a Bluetooth headset plays crashed the session's
    sound service (WirePlumber 0.5.17). The settings take effect at the next
    start of the computer.

 -- Landline <landline@d101c.github.io>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0100

landline (0.3.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The extension is turned on at the first login after the install.
  * The Bluetooth settings iPhones need are set at install time, when the
    system lacks them; removing the package puts them back.
  * The engine is no longer enabled for every session of the computer.
  * Installed from a downloaded file, the package adds its own repository.

 -- Landline <landline@d101c.github.io>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0100

